      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "1. User: \"user\" é palavra reservada no H2 e no PostgreSQL.\n   Na Etapa 3 a tabela precisa de outro nome: @Table(name = \"users\").",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. User: \"user\" é palavra reservada no H2 e no PostgreSQL.\n   Na Etapa 3 a tabela precisa de outro nome: @Table(name = \"users\").",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "te82",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -316,
      "y": 1233,
      "width": 673.9200000000001,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2933",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 564233311,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1604199940,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "2. Transaction: o Spring e o Jakarta também têm classes Transaction.\n   Ao importar, confira que é web.financialmanagement.model.Transaction.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Transaction: o Spring e o Jakarta também têm classes Transaction.\n   Ao importar, confira que é web.financialmanagement.model.Transaction.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "te83",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -316,
      "y": 1292,
      "width": 645.84,
      "height": 67.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1255388861,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 920054628,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "3. Em vermelho: nomes escolhidos para não usar palavras-chave do SQL:\n   limitAmount (limit), budgetMonth / budgetYear (month / year),\n   transactionDate (date).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Em vermelho: nomes escolhidos para não usar palavras-chave do SQL:\n   limitAmount (limit), budgetMonth / budgetYear (month / year),\n   transactionDate (date).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "te84",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -316,
      "y": 1373.5,
      "width": 636.48,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2933",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1928059963,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1253127417,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "4. Dinheiro sempre em BigDecimal (nunca double). Datas em LocalDate.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Dinheiro sempre em BigDecimal (nunca double). Datas em LocalDate.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
